    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\n`:restart` does not use the standard `EXX` error codes for when it fails:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"865\" height=\"561\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a76d3e7-e606-4182-a703-6abe2005444e\" />\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nTurn these into actual error codes, such as `E5201: Restart failed: +cmd did not quit server: echo`.\r\n\r\nThis PR only changes `restart failed: +cmd did not quit the server`. I did not add error codes for these error messages, since I was not sure if they should be turned into actual error codes:\r\n- [`restart failed: could not get listen address from new server`](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/31ad7d45274bb7b79e0cbc6a67fc69a80bb28c89/src/nvim/ex_docmd.c#L5142)\r\n- [`cannot create a channel job`](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/31ad7d45274bb7b79e0cbc6a67fc69a80bb28c89/src/nvim/ex_docmd.c#L5102)\r\n- [`killing new nvim server failed`](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/31ad7d45274bb7b79e0cbc6a67fc69a80bb28c89/src/nvim/ex_docmd.c#L5216)\r\n- [`couldn't resume listening on %s`](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/31ad7d45274bb7b79e0cbc6a67fc69a80bb28c89/src/nvim/ex_docmd.c#L5222)\r\n\r\n@justinmk I would appreciate your feedback on if any of these above should also get error codes.\r\n\r\n~~Tests will need to be rebased after #40746 is merged.~~ Done!",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-17T17:52:56Z",
